From a8b2635d19d8e8a27cc9b0c9b45fd37e25a1ed8e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Michal=20Brng=C3=A1l?= <michal@brngal.sk>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 10:39:24 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Fix GHSA-3cr5-j632-f35r (CVE-2025-1220): NUL byte in
 hostnames

fsockopen() and stream_socket_client() ignored everything after a NUL
in the host name, so a host that passed an allow-list check could
connect elsewhere. Such host names are now rejected.

Backport of php-src cac8f7f1cf (Jakub Zelenka), Sury's 7.2 patch 0186.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
