The memchr() length underflowed when the wildcard prefix and suffix
overlapped in the subject name (CN "a*aaaa" against peer "aaaa"), so a
TLS peer could make the client read past the buffer.

Backport of php-src 78cc82b37a (Jakub Zelenka), Sury's 7.2 patch 0205.

