Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 18:34:14 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Fix bug #81719 (CVE-2022-31626): mysqlnd/pdo password buffer
 overflow

mysqlnd copied a password longer than the space left in its auth packet
buffer. Where a third party can supply both the server and a long
password (database admin tools), that overflowed the heap.

Backport of php-src 58006537fc (Stanislav Malyshev), Sury's 7.2 patch
0089. 7.4 has it since 7.4.30.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
