From 9c2df730fca8981e0a99dde6927dd7144160f3a7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Michal=20Brng=C3=A1l?= <michal@brngal.sk>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 18:34:16 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Fix GHSA-r977-prxv-hc43 (CVE-2024-11233): qprint decode
 over-read

convert.quoted-printable-decode read one byte past the buffer on
input ending in a soft line break. Move the bound check before the read.

Also takes bug #74267 in the same filter, which crashed on some invalid sequences because two conditions meant to be
exclusive were not, and it dereferenced NULL input pointers at flush.

Backport of php-src 81030c9bbb (Niels Dossche) and 12c59f6660
(Christoph M. Becker), Sury's 7.2 patches 0137 and 0138.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
