From e678f095c6330e625801c61335180d2a46225eed Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Michal=20Brng=C3=A1l?= <michal@brngal.sk>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 18:34:19 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Fix GHSA-88hq-2827-7pg6 (CVE-2026-92842): convert filter
 lbchars NUL

The base64-encode and quoted-printable encode/decode filters copied the
line-break-chars option with pestrdup(), which stops at a NUL byte,
but kept its full length, then copied that many bytes from the shorter
allocation.

Backport of php-src b4e3397ec8 (geeknik), Sury's 7.2 patch 0199.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
